{
  "caveats": [
    "The census measures use regardless of ownership. These figures are neither device counts nor subscriptions, individual internet-use rates, registered vehicle stocks or measures of connection quality. Households can use several types of equipment, so categories are not additive. Sector shares use different household denominators; the national figure overlaps the four sectors. Other is left as the source’s unspecified category. Percentages are rounded to one decimal place.",
    "Published shares use one decimal place. Equipment categories overlap and are not a composition of all households."
  ],
