  "grain": "One equipment-use share by census sector in 2024",
  "notes": [
    "The 2024 census reports the share of households using 13 types of communications equipment, internet facilities and vehicles. The table covers Sri Lanka and the urban, estate-urban, rural and estate-rural sectors. Equipment includes phones, computers, radio, television, bicycles, motorcycles or scooters, and three-wheelers."
